 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Owe no one anything, except to love one another",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever loves the other has fulfilled the law",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The commandments are summed up in this simple word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love your neighbor as yourself, that is the road",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hour has already come for you to wake from sleep",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Salvation is nearer to us now than when we first believed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The night is nearly over, the day is at hand",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us cast off the works of darkness, put on the armor of light",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Live decently, as in the daytime, not in carousing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not in drunkenness, not in sexual immorality",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not in quarreling, not in jealousy or strife",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
